<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
{{>layout/favicon}}
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>그래비티 - 트리플에스 커뮤니티</title>
<script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com?plugins=forms"></script>
<script src="/js/tailwind.config.js"></script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
<style>body{background:#0d0e12;color:#e3e2e8} .gravity-card{background:#16181f;border:1px solid #ffffff18;border-radius:16px;padding:24px} .gravity-card a{color:#00f5d4} .gravity-notice{border:1px solid #fbbf2440;background:#fbbf2408;padding:16px;border-radius:12px}</style>
</head><body class="min-h-screen flex flex-col">
{{>layout/header}}
<main class="flex-1 max-w-6xl w-full mx-auto px-4 py-8 space-y-6">

<div><p class="text-xs tracking-widest text-[#00f5d4]">COSMO GRAVITY</p><h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-2">그래비티</h1><p class="text-gray-400 mt-3">진행 중인 투표와 역대 그래비티의 공식 결과를 확인하세요.</p></div>
<nav class="flex gap-4"><a href="?artistId=tripleS">tripleS</a><a href="?artistId=artms">ARTMS</a><a href="?artistId=idntt">idntt</a></nav>
<p class="text-sm text-gray-400">선택한 아티스트: {{artistId}}</p>
{{#gravityListError}}<p role="status" class="gravity-notice">{{gravityListError}}</p>{{/gravityListError}}
{{#emptyList}}<p class="gravity-card">등록된 그래비티가 없습니다.</p>{{/emptyList}}
<div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
{{#gravityList}}
<article class="gravity-card space-y-3">
{{#bannerImageUrl}}<img src="{{bannerImageUrl}}" alt="" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" class="rounded-lg w-full aspect-video object-cover">{{/bannerImageUrl}}
<p class="text-xs text-[#00f5d4]">{{statusLabel}} · {{type}}</p>
<h2 class="text-xl font-bold"><a href="{{detailUrl}}">{{title}}</a></h2>
<p class="text-sm text-gray-400">{{description}}</p>
<p class="text-xs text-gray-400">{{entireStartDate}} ~ {{entireEndDate}}</p>
{{#result}}<p class="text-sm">총 사용 COMO: {{totalComoUsed}}</p>{{/result}}
<a class="inline-block text-sm" href="{{detailUrl}}">투표 및 결과 보기 →</a>
</article>
{{/gravityList}}
</div>
<p class="text-sm text-gray-400"><a href="/cosmo/gravity/connect">관리자 · COSMO 계정 연결</a></p>
<details class="gravity-card"><summary class="cursor-pointer">투표 ID로 집계 조회</summary>
<form action="/cosmo/gravity" method="get" class="flex gap-3 mt-4"><input type="hidden" name="artistId" value="{{artistId}}"><label>투표 ID <input type="number" name="pollId" min="1" required class="bg-black rounded text-white" {{#selectedPollId}}value="{{selectedPollId}}"{{/selectedPollId}}></label><button type="submit" class="text-[#00f5d4]">조회</button></form>
{{#aggregationError}}<p class="gravity-notice mt-4">{{aggregationError}}</p>{{/aggregationError}}
{{#aggregation}}<p class="mt-4">투표 수: {{totalVoteCount}} · 사용 COMO: {{totalComoCount}} · 공개된 투표 수: {{revealedVoteCount}}</p>{{/aggregation}}
</details>
</main>{{>layout/footer}}</body></html>
